---
/**
 * CollaboratePeriodism
 *
 * Home section that encourages users to support rights-based journalism.
 *
 * Responsibilities:
 * - Communicate the mission and values of the media outlet.
 * - Highlight the importance of user contributions.
 * - Provide a clear call-to-action to collaborate.
 *
 * Notes:
 * - Static promotional section.
 * - Focused on clarity, trust, and accessibility.
 */
import "./ColaboratePeriodism.css";
---

<section class="colaborate-periodism__container">
  <div class="colaborate-periodism__content">
    <h2 class="colaborate-periodism__tittle">
      Sostené periodismo con derechos
    </h2>
    <p class="colaborate-periodism__subtittle">
      Vivir Plenamente es un medio comprometido con la defensa de los derechos
      de las personas mayores. Tu aporte nos permite seguir generando contenidos
      de clidad, libres y accesibles.
    </p>

    <div class="colaborate-periodism__button-wrapper">
      <a href="/donaciones" class="colaborate-periodism__button"> Quiero colaborar </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
